      "end_time": 15.175,
      "duration": 2.8,
      "phoneme_count": 37
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "sentence": "Melino\u00eb has much to do.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 5,
      "start_time": 15.175,
      "end_time": 17.575,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "phoneme_count": 26
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "sentence": "In Hades II, Melino\u00eb must defeat Chronos, a calculating, lanky giant who resides atop a dungeon-filled Mount Olympus.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 18,
      "start_time": 17.575,
      "end_time": 27.275,
      "duration": 9.7,
      "phoneme_count": 127
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "sentence": "The task feels Sisyphean, but she perseveres. \u201cDeath to Chronos\u201d is close to the first thing she utters, as she dreams of vengeance and freeing her parents, Hades and Persephone.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 30,
      "start_time": 27.275,
      "end_time": 39.8,
      "duration": 12.525,
      "phoneme_count": 176
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "sentence": "She often broods near a painting of the family posing together.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 11,
      "start_time": 39.8,
      "end_time": 44.3,
      "duration": 4.5,
      "phoneme_count": 62
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "sentence": "In this brilliantly balanced and elegant sequel of titans and witches, it\u2019s not Melino\u00eb\u2019s godliness that shines.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 17,
      "start_time": 44.3,
      "end_time": 52.25,
      "duration": 7.95,
      "phoneme_count": 112
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "sentence": "It\u2019s her strength of character.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 5,
      "start_time": 52.25,
      "end_time": 54.625,
      "duration": 2.375,
      "phoneme_count": 30
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "sentence": "She begins as a weak entity, becoming more powerful each time she travels through Hades and, later, the world above it.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 21,
      "start_time": 54.625,
      "end_time": 63.2,
      "duration": 8.575,
      "phoneme_count": 118
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "sentence": "To aid her cause, she might equip a heavy, silvery Moonstone Axe and the gift of a Ghost Onion, extra health offered by Dora in exchange for fruit.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 28,
      "start_time": 63.2,
      "end_time": 74.025,
      "duration": 10.825,
      "phoneme_count": 149
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "sentence": "This sweet, cranky and occasionally verbally violent soul mate sometimes unexpectedly desires life.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 13,
      "start_time": 74.025,
      "end_time": 81.725,
      "duration": 7.7,
      "phoneme_count": 103
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "sentence": "Melino\u00eb never knows what the nonplayer characters like Dora will say, part of what kept me going through constant dying.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 20,
      "start_time": 81.725,
      "end_time": 90.375,
      "duration": 8.65,
      "phoneme_count": 122
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "sentence": "Very early on, the emanating sound waves from a demonic wailer killed me.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 13,
      "start_time": 90.375,
      "end_time": 96.325,
      "duration": 5.95,
      "phoneme_count": 76
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "sentence": "I respawned, down but not daunted, near Melino\u00eb\u2019s rudimentary tent, where she took a second or two to lament defeat, but only that.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 23,
      "start_time": 96.325,
      "end_time": 105.9,
      "duration": 9.575,
      "phoneme_count": 139
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "sentence": "Later under the sea, Scylla, a sadistic Harley Quinn-esque witch, emerged from a giant clam to torment me.",
